w: Teach us no thought- less word to say, But from our in- most heart to pray. 
w: Let no false doc- trine us per- vert; All poor, de- lu- ded souls con- vert. 
w: Break Sa- tan's pow'r, de- feat his rage; Pre- serve Thy Church from age to age. 
w: Curb flesh and blood and ev- 'ry ill That sets it- self a- gainst Thy will. 
w: That we may live in god- ly peace, Free from all care and a- va- rice. 
w: Thus let us dwell in char- it- y And serve our bro- ther will- ing- ly.
